"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_18", "クレス・オルデンバーグと妻のクーシャ・ファン・ブリュッゲンによる弓矢のパブリックアート。",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_19", "植物などをモチーフとした色鮮やかなタイルで装飾された階段。",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_2", "アドルフ・スートロによって1894年に建てられた巨大な公共塩水プール施設の廃墟。",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_20", "ゴールデンステート・ウォリアーズの本拠地。",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_21", "サンフランシスコ・ジャイアンツで活躍した選手ウィリー・メイズの青銅像。",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_22", "This paddock has been home to Golden Gate Park’s resident bison herd since the 1890s.",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_23", "A formal plaza created for the 1894 California Midwinter International Exposition, now neighbored by the de Young Museum and California Academy of Sciences.",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_24", "A charming Golden Gate Park lakeside spot offering snacks and paddle boat rentals.",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_25", "A Civil War–era brick fortress tucked beneath the Golden Gate Bridge.",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_26", "A former military post turned national park.",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_27", "A sandy Presidio beach with close-up bridge views.",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_28", "A breezy waterfront lawn and popular picnic spot.",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_29", "A 1986 sound sculpture by Peter Richards and George Gonzales that uses pipes, stone, and tidal movement to create low acoustic tones from the Bay.",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_3", "テレグラフ・ヒル上に建つアール・デコ調の展望台。",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_30", "One of the Presidio’s oldest footpaths.",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_31", "The Presidio Tunnel Tops’ main lawn, built over the Doyle Drive tunnels.",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_32", "A classic downtown shopping plaza and home to the San Francisco Nintendo Store!",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_33", "The ceremonial entrance to Chinatown on Grant Avenue, flanked by traditional stone lions.",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_4", "コースタル・トレイルの出発点イーグル・ポイントにある石を並べてつくられた迷路。",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_5", "アンディ・ゴールズワージーが2011年にユーカリの森に完成させた木彫刻作品。",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_6", "1915年開催のパナマ・太平洋万国博覧会のイベント会場を、より強固な素材で再建し保存した建造物。",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_7", "ノースビーチ地区にある芝生広場の公園。",
"rally_pxp_2026_stamp_description_8", "建築家ウィリアム・ペレイラ設計、1972年に完成した超高層ビル。サンフランシスコの代表的ランドマーク。",
